%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S8_X1_2b
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: I decide to spend the next 30 minutes in the break room and sip my coffee
      with enjoyment.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Then the door suddenly opens, and the person I didn't want to show up the
      most enters the room.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: There you are.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I sit up straight immediately.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, I was just taking a quick break.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She looks at me doubtfully.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: For half an hour? The others confirmed that you've been gone for quite
      some time now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Tsk. Those traitors.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I apologise, Miss Moon. I just have a lot on my mind right now. With the
      earthquake that happened and all\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't understand why you're so unmotivated right now. Did someone close
      to you get hurt by the earthquake, or did something of the sort happen?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: No, everything is okay, just some furniture that needs to be replaced.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Then I really don't understand. The earthquake was yesterday. It didn't
      have any significant effects for us. So why?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I \u2026 I just \u2026 I don't know. I'm sorry. I will get my act together."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Am I the only one that finds this a bit too hectic right now? It's true.
      Everyone else doesn't seem to mind work right now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You're still relatively new here, so I expect you to show me that I didn't
      make a mistake in hiring you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I guess she has a point.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ashamed I look down on the floor.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes ma'am, I'll do my best.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Then show it. Finish the extra work I left on your desk by the end of today.
      And understand that I do this because I care about the company and its staff.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0da3ca1f8a6962f4b9b7873516fd35e9, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So she's saying this is my punishment for slacking off for half an hour
      and that I'll lose my job if I can't prove that I'm hard-working.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I already dread the sight of my desk and just nod.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Miss Moon finally leaves the room, and I breathe a sigh of relief as all
      the tension leaves my body.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't know what's wrong with me. Why can't I get it together? Now I got
      scolded by the office fury.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ff4ebcdba0d15c42b065336944f4a8a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0718293a4b5c6d7e8f901ab2c3d4e5f6, type: 2}
